<title>USA: NBA BASKETBALL - BULLS WIN GAME 6 TO CLINCH CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>NBA BASKETBALL - BULLS WIN GAME 6 TO CLINCH CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of Game 6 of the best-of-seven NBA Finals on Friday (home team in CAPS):</p>
<p> CHICAGO	   90    Utah	     86</p>
<p>(Chicago wins best-of-seven series 4-2)</p>
